# OpenSimulator modules, packaged as opensim-<core>-<module>, where <core> is a
# release (the last one of packaging/opensim-core.versions, or MODULES_CORE) or
# unstable, each in /usr/share/opensim-modules/<core>/<module>, not loaded
# until enabled.
# One line per file: module, core, module version (0.0~git<date>.<commit> for
# a snapshot of an unversioned source), packaging revision (the next one for
# any change to a published package), file: a path in this repository, or a
# URL followed by its SHA256 and the name to install.

# Compiled for OpenSim 0.9.2.2, until built for each release
